This preset (two-stage-promotion / 二阶段晋升模式) ships with the
dsh-two-stage-promotion package and is synced into
~/.dsh/.agent-presets/two-stage-promotion on host startup.

Upstream lineage:
- xiaobright/dsh-anchored-standard (MIT) — two-phase bootstrap plugin design.
- @linxin666/dsh-liangshen (Apache-2.0) — preset packaging and host-side sync.

Local fixes carried here:
- tool-bootstrap.mjs: feature-detected Session event access — legacy DSH
  `session.events` vs current DSH `session.snapshotEvents()` (0.1.2-rc.1+).
  The legacy-only read crashed every turn on the current DSH with
  "Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'length')".
- Black-box diagnostics: listener crashes append full stacks to
  /tmp/two-stage-promotion-crash.log; a MOUNT marker is written per apply().

The plugin that owns this preset (dsh-two-stage-promotion) only manages this
directory; user-authored sibling presets are never touched.
